# Rapier Wit: "Tap target creature. If it's your turn, put a stun counter on it. Draw a card." On Bot1's turn three it taps
# Bot2's Ornithopter and stuns it, and Bot1 draws. On turn four the untap step removes the counter instead of untapping
# the Ornithopter (CR 122.1d); on turn six it untaps.

[Bot1 Deck]
Rapier Wit
Mox Pearl x2
Island x4
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rapier Wit.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Stun = 1
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Stun = (absent)
[T6 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
